{"3729210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Oathbearer", "steam_appid": 3729210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729210/extras/7e276b8b19f277e69fb64214d0bf2fdf.avif?t=1788011109\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729210/extras/d13d122424d11e36a25e8ffd07fb7a16.avif?t=1788011109\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are the last descendant of a broken order, bound by an oath and kept alive by ancient shrines.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Oathbearer</i></strong> is a stylized Soulslike action-RPG about <strong>mastery, discovery, and consequence</strong> where every fight tests your skill and every ruin hides a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Awaits You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <i>Learn to Fight</i> – Weighty combat that rewards timing, parries, and smart stamina use.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <i>Wield Spells That Matter</i> – Fire, frost, and other elements not only win fights  they reshape the world and reveal hidden paths.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <i>Face Colossal Bosses</i> – Multi-phase encounters in arenas that break and evolve mid-battle.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <i>Build Your Legend</i> – Equip unique weapons, upgrade gear, and specialize your playstyle — from juggernaut to nimble spellblade.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <i>Choose an Ending</i> – The oath you bear decides whether the Abyss is ended… or inherited.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Play Oathbearer?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you crave <i>challenging combat, unforgettable bosses, and dark fantasy atmosphere</i> <strong><i>Oathbearer</i></strong> delivers a focused journey where every victory feels earned. The world is stylized for clarity and drama — striking silhouettes, bold lighting, and ruins that beg to be explored.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Now</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow development and play the demo at Steam Next Fest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729210/extras/1e30c4555080ce36dcc937c994bd4d72.avif?t=1788011109\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729210/extras/d13d122424d11e36a25e8ffd07fb7a16.avif?t=1788011109\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are the last descendant of a broken order, bound by an oath and kept alive by ancient shrines.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Oathbearer</i></strong> is a stylized Soulslike action-RPG about <strong>mastery, discovery, and consequence</strong> where every fight tests your skill and every ruin hides a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Awaits You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <i>Learn to Fight</i> – Weighty combat that rewards timing, parries, and smart stamina use.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <i>Wield Spells That Matter</i> – Fire, frost, and other elements not only win fights  they reshape the world and reveal hidden paths.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <i>Face Colossal Bosses</i> – Multi-phase encounters in arenas that break and evolve mid-battle.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <i>Build Your Legend</i> – Equip unique weapons, upgrade gear, and specialize your playstyle — from juggernaut to nimble spellblade.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <i>Choose an Ending</i> – The oath you bear decides whether the Abyss is ended… or inherited.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Play Oathbearer?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you crave <i>challenging combat, unforgettable bosses, and dark fantasy atmosphere</i> <strong><i>Oathbearer</i></strong> delivers a focused journey where every victory feels earned. The world is stylized for clarity and drama — striking silhouettes, bold lighting, and ruins that beg to be explored.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Now</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow development and play the demo at Steam Next Fest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729210/extras/1e30c4555080ce36dcc937c994bd4d72.avif?t=1788011109\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Oathbearer is a stylized Soulslike action-RPG. Master weighty, timing-based combat, wield elemental magic to reshape ruins, and topple colossal multi-phase bosses to end the Abyss… or take it.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729210/51d91a7e0f3fb8f6b4aff4c71fab00bfa1cab3b8/header.jpg?t=1788011109", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729210/b6281cb87c611808a49c9f8775cdc68e127c788d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788011109", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729210/b6281cb87c611808a49c9f8775cdc68e127c788d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788011109", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Window 7 64Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</s